            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lacylue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was a HIT! I omitted the jalapeno peppers and substituted diced red pepper and onions and left everything else the same. I rolled half of it completely with chopped pecans and added the left overs mixed into the other half. Will definitely make this again!",
            "datePublished": "2008-11-16T18:10:53.443Z"
          },
          {
