              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jwiese62"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made different cheese balls over the years, but this is by far the best!! I omitted the green pepper, and used red pepper instead, running it through my food processor along with the jalapeño. I'll be making this several times over the Holidays!",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-10T06:58:58.613Z"
